# The媒体 stays out, the source comes in.
#
# Same rule as /public/event/*/ at the repository root, and for the same reason:
# these folders hold licensed stock photography, portraits of real people and
# supplied music. Pushing them would publish licensed and personal media into
# git history, which a later delete cannot undo.
#
# The SOURCE is committed on purpose — it is the measurement (see README.md).
*/public/
*/node_modules/
*/out/
*/.remotion/
